\documentclass{article}
\begin{document}
\section{Introduction}
\label{intro}
Causal inference from observational data requires untestable assumptions.
\section{Identification}
\label{method}
We use an instrumental variable; Section~\ref{intro} explained why randomization is infeasible.
\section{Results}
\label{result}
The estimate from Section~\ref{method} is significant. Section~\ref{intro} motivated this estimand, and Section~\ref{result} reports robustness in the appendix.
\end{document}

